    "body": "Review fix pushed at a0d4963b (merged upstream/main, then the link fixes).\n\n1. Links to glossary, order-of-operations, troubleshooting and workflows are now `@/guide/<page>.md`. The `machines` target is not on main yet (no `site/content/guide/machines.md` in upstream/main), so per the merge rule those three links are plain text \"Machine types\" until that page merges: `fundamentals/_index.md`, `fundamentals/chips-and-coolant.md`, `fundamentals/post-and-machine.md`.\n2. `units-and-coordinates`, `workholding` and `operations-multiaxis` are `@/guide/...md` links.\n3. Other links: a grep of `site/content` found no other absolute camcraft-site URLs. The 18 absolute links were all in `guide/fundamentals/` and are converted. Relative guide links: none.\n\nAlso: `guide/_index.md` conflict with upstream/main kept both sides (the CAM fundamentals paragraph and the glossary/workflows/troubleshooting paragraphs).\n\n`zola build` (zola 0.23.6, in site/): passed, exit 0, \"Creating 34 pages (0 orphan) and 3 sections\". Every `@/` target checked to exist in the merged tree.\n\nReady for a re-review.\n",
